			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="380" height="380" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Medical.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Medical.png 380w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Medical-150x150.png 150w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Medical-300x300.png 300w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Medical-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 380px) 100vw, 380px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Healthcare</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description"> No Arizonan, and no American for that matter, should ever have to weigh a decision to visit the hospital against the need to stay home to avoid the cost of care. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
				<div data-id="112565dc" class="elementor-element elementor-element-112565dc elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle animated fadeInLeft elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-element_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="276" height="276" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Jobs.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Jobs.png 276w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Jobs-150x150.png 150w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Jobs-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 276px) 100vw, 276px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Jobs</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">In LD 24, Marcus will fight to raise the minimum wage to $15 an hour, while opposing policies that harm families and exploit workers. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
				<div data-id="2863ca51" class="elementor-element elementor-element-2863ca51 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle animated fadeInLeft elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}" data-element_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="326" height="326" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Justice.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Justice.png 326w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Justice-150x150.png 150w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Justice-300x300.png 300w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Justice-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 326px) 100vw, 326px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Criminal Justice</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">As your representative, Marcus will fight to end mass incarceration and to kick the private prison companies out of our state. True criminal justice reform must serve people and families, not large corporations. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
						</div>
			</div>
		</div>
				<div data-id="5b183cf3" class="elementor-element elementor-element-5b183cf3 elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-column-wrap elementor-element-populated">
					<div class="elementor-widget-wrap">
				<div data-id="6e908360" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e908360 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle animated fadeInRight elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-element_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="353" height="354" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Education.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Education.png 353w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Education-150x150.png 150w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Education-300x300.png 300w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Education-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 353px) 100vw, 353px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Education</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Massive demonstrations in West Virginia and around the country are highlighting a problem that many Arizonans are too familiar with already -- that teacher salaries are not sufficient to support educators.. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
				<div data-id="672dca91" class="elementor-element elementor-element-672dca91 elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle animated fadeInRight elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-element_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="128" height="128" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/User.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/User.png 128w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/User-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Immigration</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">As state representative, Marcus will fight to establish Arizona as a sanctuary state and to enact policies that support migrant workers and families, protecting them from exploitation. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
				<div data-id="4d3b91af" class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d3b91af elementor-position-left elementor-vertical-align-middle animated fadeInRight elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInRight&quot;}" data-element_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/"><img width="238" height="238" src="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Equality.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" srcset="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Equality.png 238w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Equality-150x150.png 150w, https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642im_/https://www.ferrellfor24.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/04/Equality-50x50.png 50w" sizes="(max-width: 238px) 100vw, 238px"/></a></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><h3 class="elementor-image-box-title"><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">Equality</a></h3><p class="elementor-image-box-description">Marcus will support legislation to protect LGBTQ workers from termination based on discrimination and to protect LGBTQ parents’ right to adopt. (<a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180706022642/http://www.ferrellfor24.com/issues/">read more..</a>)</p></div></div>		</div>
				</div>
						</div>
			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
			</div>
		</section>
						</div>
